status GREEN, and sent -- the hot pass reads 184 run, 181 green, 0 red, 3 custody-gated, `run_verdict=ok`; reds_ledger_headline, reds_ledger_monotone, reds_pin_capacity, log_has_a_row, tool_letter_room, generated_page_freshness all green on metal, the roster's undeclared ratchet back under its ceiling at 62, and the rule-two fix proven from both sides by reverting the line and watching the leg read no
recommend keep-going -- recover `stash@{2}`, the `rish_report_bound` guard family: the larger of the two parked laps, and the only one whose files nothing else in the tree carries.
